    "summary": "Whenever this **DREADNOUGHT** is **selected to fight**, it can pick an enemy unit in its **Engagement Range** and roll a D6, adding 2 if this turn it made a **Charge move**:\n\n- 4-5: the enemy unit takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**\n- 6+: the enemy unit takes 3 mortal wounds",
